==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.67~8 seconds<sup>20f~240f</sup>.
*100 [[Snache]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 13.33~40 seconds<sup>400f~1,200f</sup>.
*5 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.
*2 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Mooth]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 2~13.33 seconds<sup>60f~400f</sup>.
**10 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

